{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "f2774fd4-8842-4d4f-9e53-00f0135f28d8",
    "name": "Fortinet FortiFlex V2.0 (FlexVM)",
    "description": "The FortiFlex REST API\n\nFor more detail about the FortiFlex REST API please reference the [FNDN documentation](https://fndn.fortinet.net/index.php?/fortiapi/954-fortiflex/).\n\nWhen using this collection **update the Collection Variables** with your\n\n- api-username - used by the Authenticate POST request \"Retrieve Auth Token\"\n    \n- api-password - used by the Authenticate POST request \"Retrieve Auth Token\"\n    \n- accountid - used by several requests in the collection, review the request body or the [FNDN documentation](https://fndn.fortinet.net/index.php?/fortiapi/954-fortiflex/).\n    \n\nThese Collection Variables are **automatically created** after running the Authenticate POST request - \"Retrieve Auth Token\"\n\n- access-token\n    \n- refresh-token\n    \n\nThe Collection Variable\n\n- programSerialNumber\n    \n\n**will be updated** with the first \"serialNumber\" found in the list of returned \"programs\". Update this variable to view a differnet programSerialNumber that your API account credentials have access to, running the Programs POST request - \"list\" will overwrite the \"programsSerialNumber\" in the Collection Variables.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "347075",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/347075-f2774fd4-8842-4d4f-9e53-00f0135f28d8?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Programs",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "list",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Extract first program's serialNumber and store as collection variable; accountId is manual",
                  "try {",
                  "  let arr = [];",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (Array.isArray(j)) {",
                  "    arr = j;",
                  "  } else if (j && Array.isArray(j.programs)) {",
                  "    arr = j.programs;",
                  "  } else if (j && j.data && Array.isArray(j.data.programs)) {",
                  "    arr = j.data.programs;",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (arr.length) {",
                  "    const first = arr[0];",
                  "    const sn = first.programSerialNumber || first.serialNumber;",
                  "    if (sn) pm.collectionVariables.set('programSerialNumber', sn);",
                  "    console.log('Set programSerialNumber from Programs/list');",
                  "  } else {",
                  "    console.log('Programs/list returned no programs');",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) { console.log('Failed parsing Programs/list response', e); }"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://support.fortinet.com/ES/api/fortiflex/v2/programs/list",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": [
                "support",
                "fortinet",
                "com"
              ],
              "path": [
                "ES",
                "api",
                "fortiflex",
                "v2",
                "programs",
                "list"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
